WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.023 --> 00:00:02.700
- Do you guys think dog owner
really look like their dogs?

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.446
We're gonna have random
contestants try to match

00:00:04.446 --> 00:00:07.304
these dog owners to their
dogs, and we'll find out.

00:00:07.304 --> 00:00:10.932
Dog owners, could you
please give me your leashes?

00:00:10.932 --> 00:00:11.915
- Good lord.

00:00:11.915 --> 00:00:12.919
- Jesus.

00:00:12.919 --> 00:00:15.919
(upbeat rock music)

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:18.896
- Zack, do you think people are gonna know

00:00:18.896 --> 00:00:19.814
that Franklin's your dog?

00:00:19.814 --> 00:00:22.196
- I think so, because
we're both pretty big dogs,

00:00:22.196 --> 00:00:24.508
and I think people can put two
and two together like that.

00:00:24.508 --> 00:00:27.251
- We're both blonde and very high energy.

00:00:27.251 --> 00:00:28.466
- I think you can tell he is my dog,

00:00:28.466 --> 00:00:32.576
cuz we both have droopy red
eyes, and resting sad face.

00:00:32.576 --> 00:00:34.192
- If you just look at me,
you wouldn't think that

00:00:34.192 --> 00:00:37.731
I would have a dog this small and cute.

00:00:37.731 --> 00:00:41.824
- I have some light hair
highlights like she does.

00:00:41.824 --> 00:00:43.960
- Got the same hair, hair color.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:46.155
- I don't think we really
have the same body type.

00:00:46.155 --> 00:00:47.734
- Samson, do you think
people are gonna know

00:00:47.734 --> 00:00:49.401
Morgan's your human?

00:00:50.477 --> 00:00:51.310
- Mhm.

00:00:51.310 --> 00:00:53.637
- So Nina, do you think
dogs look like their people?

00:00:53.637 --> 00:00:55.229
- Yeah, often.

00:00:55.229 --> 00:00:56.717
- I think sometimes, yeah.

00:00:56.717 --> 00:00:58.037
- Do you think you're
gonna be able to match

00:00:58.037 --> 00:00:59.685
these people to their
dogs based on their looks?

00:00:59.685 --> 00:01:01.696
- I will do my best, yes.

00:01:01.696 --> 00:01:04.003
- Hand the leash of the dog to
the person you think owns it.

00:01:04.003 --> 00:01:05.081
- Oh my God.

00:01:05.081 --> 00:01:05.914
Sorry.

00:01:05.914 --> 00:01:06.747
All right.

00:01:06.747 --> 00:01:07.992
This one is for red pants.

00:01:07.992 --> 00:01:08.825
- Thanks.

00:01:08.825 --> 00:01:09.658
(dogs bark)

00:01:09.658 --> 00:01:11.249
(chuckling)

00:01:11.249 --> 00:01:13.029
- How about (mumbles)?

00:01:13.029 --> 00:01:14.105
(chuckles)

00:01:14.105 --> 00:01:16.438
Let's go to your dad or mom.

00:01:17.728 --> 00:01:21.204
- [Man with red hair] The
faster the better for me.

00:01:21.204 --> 00:01:22.699
Oop.

00:01:22.699 --> 00:01:23.532
(dogs bark)

00:01:23.532 --> 00:01:24.365
- What?

00:01:24.365 --> 00:01:25.338
Is it the hat?

00:01:25.338 --> 00:01:26.197
- Dogs hate hats.

00:01:26.197 --> 00:01:27.282
- Dogs hate hats.

00:01:27.282 --> 00:01:29.530
(all laugh)

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:30.697
- I guess you.

00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:33.166
- Thank you.

00:01:33.166 --> 00:01:35.697
- Matching them up with
confidence over here, Nina.

00:01:35.697 --> 00:01:36.530
Good work.

00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:38.584
- [Nina] It's all in the face.

00:01:38.584 --> 00:01:40.672
- Hugo, how do you think you did?

00:01:40.672 --> 00:01:42.193
- Horrible.

00:01:42.193 --> 00:01:45.046
- How many do you think you got right?

00:01:45.046 --> 00:01:46.484
- Two, maybe?

00:01:46.484 --> 00:01:48.781
- How confident are you
that you have these right?

00:01:48.781 --> 00:01:50.200
- I'm pretty confident.

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:51.580
- I think I got two right.

00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:53.728
- So Megan, is this your dog? (buzz)

00:01:53.728 --> 00:01:54.561
- It is not.

00:01:54.561 --> 00:01:56.524
- Samson, is that your human?

00:01:56.524 --> 00:01:59.198
(dog whines sadly)

00:01:59.198 --> 00:02:01.902
- Samson is not my dog, nor
does he wanna be my dog.

00:02:01.902 --> 00:02:03.493
- Franklin is not my dog. (buzz)

00:02:03.493 --> 00:02:05.359
- Cannot pull Fay over here, cuz she is so

00:02:05.359 --> 00:02:07.753
desperate to get back to Megan (laughs).

00:02:07.753 --> 00:02:08.944
- Ah! (buzz)

00:02:08.944 --> 00:02:10.312
What? (buzz)

00:02:10.312 --> 00:02:11.496
- Roxy is not my dog. (buzz)

00:02:11.496 --> 00:02:12.814
She's my dog.

00:02:12.814 --> 00:02:14.013
- [Girl in Jeans] Yes!

00:02:14.013 --> 00:02:15.834
(all laugh)

00:02:15.834 --> 00:02:17.655
- Megan, is Roxy your dog?

00:02:17.655 --> 00:02:18.867
- She is not. (buzz)

00:02:18.867 --> 00:02:20.555
- Fay is not my dog. (buzz)

00:02:20.555 --> 00:02:23.486
- Franklin is not my dog,
(buzz) but I'm honored

00:02:23.486 --> 00:02:24.998
that you think that he is.

00:02:24.998 --> 00:02:26.039
- Aw.

00:02:26.039 --> 00:02:27.426
- Claire is not my dog. (buzz)

00:02:27.426 --> 00:02:28.962
(all laugh)

00:02:28.962 --> 00:02:29.940
- Chewie my dog.

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:30.773
(ding)

00:02:30.773 --> 00:02:31.606
- Good.

00:02:31.606 --> 00:02:32.531
You have the same hair.

00:02:32.531 --> 00:02:33.703
- Samson is not my dog. (buzz)

00:02:33.703 --> 00:02:35.128
- What?

00:02:35.128 --> 00:02:36.376
- Darling is my dog.

00:02:36.376 --> 00:02:37.324
- Oh good!

00:02:37.324 --> 00:02:38.179
- So two correct.

00:02:38.179 --> 00:02:39.012
- Okay.

00:02:39.012 --> 00:02:40.480
- You ready to find out the real answers?

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:41.619
- Yeah, let's go.

00:02:41.619 --> 00:02:43.077
- Is Fay your dog?

00:02:43.077 --> 00:02:44.299
- (ding) Fay is my dog.

00:02:44.299 --> 00:02:46.458
- Samson is not my dog. (buzz)

00:02:46.458 --> 00:02:48.271
- Yeah, Rocky's my dog. (ding)

00:02:48.271 --> 00:02:49.638
- Chewie is my dog. (ding)

00:02:49.638 --> 00:02:51.191
- Franklin is not my dog. (buzz)

00:02:51.191 --> 00:02:52.652
- Potter is not my dog. (buzz)

00:02:52.652 --> 00:02:54.935
- And Morgan, is Darwin your dog?

00:02:54.935 --> 00:02:57.487
- Darwin is unfortunately
not my dog. (buzz)

00:02:57.487 --> 00:02:59.483
- So contestants, are you
ready to find out who won?

00:02:59.483 --> 00:03:00.512
- [Together] Yes.

00:03:00.512 --> 00:03:02.462
- It was Hugo by a long shot.

00:03:02.462 --> 00:03:03.295
- Yes!

00:03:03.295 --> 00:03:05.277
- How many did you get right, Hugo?

00:03:05.277 --> 00:03:06.656
- Three.

00:03:06.656 --> 00:03:07.489
- [Together] Aw.

00:03:07.489 --> 00:03:08.542
- How's it feel to be a champion?

00:03:08.542 --> 00:03:10.842
(Hugo barks)

00:03:10.842 --> 00:03:12.770
- Awesome (chuckles).

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:14.912
- And how does it feel to be a loser?

00:03:14.912 --> 00:03:16.946
- Great (laughs).

00:03:16.946 --> 00:03:20.516
- I feel like I should get a
dog as my consolation prize.

00:03:20.516 --> 00:03:22.936
- All right dog owners,
get your real dogs.

00:03:22.936 --> 00:03:24.523
- Here you go.

00:03:24.523 --> 00:03:25.973
Jump into her arms.

00:03:25.973 --> 00:03:27.996
(chuckling)

00:03:27.996 --> 00:03:28.996
There we go.

00:03:30.673 --> 00:03:33.101
- I think there's some family resemblance

00:03:33.101 --> 00:03:37.641
in hair color, some eye
connections, makes sense.

00:03:37.641 --> 00:03:39.860
- Looks can be deceiving, but hey.

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:42.739
Some of them like she
said, yeah, they look

00:03:42.739 --> 00:03:43.824
quite like their owners.

00:03:43.824 --> 00:03:45.630
- They don't look like their owners.

00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:47.818
- Folks, that was, "Do people
really look like their dogs?"

00:03:47.818 --> 00:03:50.680
And I would say the jury
is definitely still out.

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:52.180
What do you think?

